# Day 2 - Household Energy Consumption Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview

This project is part of a **10 Days Coding Challenge**.

The objective of this project is to analyze household energy consumption patterns and identify the types of households that consume the most energy based on **family size, appliance count, income level, and month**.

The analysis helps identify high-energy-consuming households and provides suggestions for improving energy efficiency.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

* Analyze energy consumption patterns across households.
* Identify households with high electricity consumption.
* Compare electricity usage based on family size.
* Analyze electricity usage based on the number of appliances.
* Compare electricity consumption across income levels.
* Analyze monthly electricity consumption.
* Suggest energy-saving measures for high-energy-consuming households.
* Create charts and dashboards to visualize the insights.

---

## 📊 Dataset

The dataset contains **250 households**.

### Columns

| Column                  | Description                            |
| ----------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| Household_ID            | Unique household identification number |
| Family_Size             | Number of members in the household     |
| Monthly_Income          | Monthly household income               |
| Electricity_Usage (kWh) | Monthly electricity consumption        |
| Gas_Usage               | Gas consumption                        |
| Appliances_Count        | Number of appliances in the household  |
| Month                   | Month of consumption                   |

---

## 🔍 Key Analysis

### Overall Consumption

* **Total Households:** 250
* **Total Electricity Usage:** 75,335 kWh
* **Average Electricity Usage:** 301.34 kWh

### Family Size

Households with **3 family members** recorded the highest average electricity consumption at **330.63 kWh**.

### Appliance Count

Households with **7 appliances** recorded the highest average electricity consumption at **339.05 kWh** among the appliance groups analyzed.

### Income Level

The **High-income group** recorded the highest average electricity consumption at **310.65 kWh**.

### Monthly Consumption

**February** recorded the highest average electricity consumption at **349.17 kWh**.

### High-Energy Households

A **90th-percentile threshold of 470.20 kWh** was calculated to identify high-energy-consuming households.

Households consuming **470.20 kWh or more** were classified as high-energy households for this analysis.

