## 💡 Recommendations

Based on the analysis, the following energy-saving measures are suggested:

* Use energy-efficient LED lighting.
* Choose energy-efficient appliances.
* Switch off appliances when they are not being used.
* Reduce unnecessary standby power consumption.
* Regularly monitor electricity usage.
* Provide energy-efficiency awareness and support to high-energy-consuming households.

